      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "42.2 grams of fat. Omega 3 is an enormous 22813 milligrams, almost all ALA, the plant form your body can use directly and convert in small amounts into longer-chain omega 3s. Saturated fat is only 3.7 grams, keeping the fat tradeoff unusually clean. For seeds, fat quality is one of the main jobs.",
