      "id": "04-carbs",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "28.9 grams of carbs. Fibre is 27.3 grams, so nearly the entire carb number is fibre rather than digestible starch or sugar. The glycemic index is 35, and starch is only 1.3 grams. For seeds, that is what you want: fibre doing useful work without turning the food into a big starch hit.",
