    {
      "id": "06-vitamins",
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "vitamins",
      "text": "Vitamins are low all round. Vitamin K is the best mark at only 4% daily value, while vitamin E is 2%. Vitamin K supports normal blood clotting and bone proteins, and vitamin E helps protect cell membranes. Seeds usually win through fats, fibre, and minerals.",
