    {
      "id": "07-minerals",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "minerals",
      "text": "Magnesium is 93% daily value, an excellent amount for energy release plus normal nerve and muscle function. Zinc is 39% and iron is 32% daily value, supporting immunity, tissue repair, and oxygen transport. Potassium is the softer mark at 17%. For seeds, broad mineral density helps justify the dense calories.",
