    {
      "id": "10-closing_summary",
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "closing_summary",
      "sectionKey": null,
      "text": "Best bits are the massive ALA omega 3 mark, extreme fibre, useful protein, magnesium, and the lignan story. Weak spots are the thin vitamin panel, limited lysine, lower payoff from swallowing the seeds whole, and digestive tolerance. Best for heart-health-focused meals, digestion, and easy meal upgrades because the fats and fibre are strong and ground flax is simple to use.",
